WiFi 7 routers\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"5013\" height=\"2171\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"v2r34G_routerStackImg\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbroadband%2Frouters%2FPremium-Huawei-mesh-system.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"><div class=\"v2r34G_routerBox\"><p class=\"v2r34G_routerBoxLine\"><span class=\"v2r34G_routerBoxLabel\">FREE WiFi 7 (10G) ONR </span><span class=\"v2r34G_worth\">(worth $699)</span></p><p class=\"v2r34G_routerBoxLine\"><span class=\"v2r34G_routerBoxLabel\">FREE 2 X Huawei OptiXstar WiFi 7 (2.5Gb) router </span><span class=\"v2r34G_worth\">(worth $598)</span></p></div></div><div class=\"v2r34G_divider\"></div><ul class=\"v2r34G_features\"><li>FREE Home Phone Line <span class=\"v2r34G_worth\">(worth $140)</span></li><li>FREE Device Installation <span class=\"v2r34G_worth\">(worth $50)</span></li><li>FREE NLT Service Activation <span class=\"v2r34G_worth\">(worth $61.04)</span></li></ul><div class=\"v2r34G_divider\"></div><div class=\"v2r34G_description\"><p>Triple WiFi 7 Coverage.</p></div><div class=\"v2r34G_priceBlock\"><p class=\"v2r34G_price\"><span class=\"v2r34G_priceAmount\">$29.99</span><span class=\"v2r34G_priceUnit\">/30 days</span></p><p class=\"v2r34G_gst\">with GST</p></div><div class=\"v2r34G_cta\"><a href=\"https://register.simba.sg/#/order?product=FBB017\" class=\"se-btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Buy</a></div></div></div><div class=\"v2r34G_slot\"><div class=\"v2r34G_card \"><div class=\"v2r34G_badgeRow v2r34G_badgeRowEmpty\"><span class=\"v2r34G_badge\">New</span></div><div class=\"v2r34G_heading\"><h3 class=\"v2r34G_title\">10Gbps Broadband eero WiFi 7 router</h3><p class=\"v2r34G_contract\">2-year contract</p></div><div class=\"v2r34G_routerStack\"><img alt=\"eero Pro 7 10G WiFi 7 router\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"480\" height=\"480\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"v2r34G_routerStackImg\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Frouter-eero-pro-7.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75\"><div class=\"v2r34G_routerBox\"><p class=\"v2r34G_routerBoxLine\"><span class=\"v2r34G_routerBoxLabel\">FREE eero Pro 7 10G router </span><span class=\"v2r34G_worth\">(worth $599.99)</span></p></div></div><div class=\"v2r34G_divider\"></div><ul class=\"v2r34G_features\"><li>FREE ONU <span class=\"v2r34G_worth\">(worth $198)</span></li><li>FREE Home Phone Line <span class=\"v2r34G_worth\">(worth $140)</span></li><li>FREE Device Installation <span class=\"v2r34G_worth\">(worth $50)</span></li><li>FREE NLT Service Activation <span class=\"v2r34G_worth\">(worth $61.04)</span></li></ul><div class=\"v2r34G_divider\"></div><div class=\"v2r34G_description\"><p>Single WiFi 7. Router add-ons available.</p></div><div class=\"v2r34G_priceBlock\"><p class=\"v2r34G_price\"><span class=\"v2r34G_priceAmount\">$29.99</span><span class=\"v2r34G_priceUnit\">/30 days</span></p><p class=\"v2r34G_gst\">with GST</p></div><div class=\"v2r34G_cta\"><a href=\"https://register.simba.sg/#/order?product=FBB016\" class=\"se-btn-primary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Buy</a></div></div></div></div><p class=\"se-body-sm se-weight-regular\">You can now port your home line to SIMBA. Do so by submitting the form found in your service activation email. T&amp;Cs apply.</p><div><div class=\"_acL2a_wifi\"><img alt=\"Floor plan showing SIMBA WiFi router coverage reaching every room in the home\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"295\" height=\"290\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"_acL2a_wifiImage\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Ffloor-plan.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75\"><div class=\"_acL2a_wifiBody\"><h2 class=\"_acL2a_wifiTitle\">Not sure if your home WiFi is performing at its best?</h2><p class=\"_acL2a_wifiText\">Let us help you assess your home connectivity needs and explore the right solution for your household.</p><p class=\"_acL2a_wifiText se-weight-bold\">No obligation. Just better connectivity starts here!</p><div class=\"_acL2a_wifiActions\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/6580960223?text=Hi+SIMBA!+I+would+like+to+find+out+more.+%F0%9F%98%8A&amp;utm_source=website&amp;utm_content=Live+Advisor\" class=\"_acL2a_wifiCta se-body-sm se-weight-semibold\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" src=\"/images/home/icon-whatsapp.svg\">Chat with our experts today!</a><a href=\"https://go.simba.sg/wificonsultation\" class=\"_acL2a_wifiCta se-body-sm se-weight-semibold\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Ficon-clipboard.png&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\">Leave your details &amp; we'll get in touch with you</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class=\"bm3YjG_section\"><div class=\"se-section\"><h2 class=\"bm3YjG_title\">Trusted by <span class=\"bm3YjG_count\">1M+</span> Customers</h2><p class=\"bm3YjG_subtitle\">Google reviews from SIMBA customers</p><div class=\"bm3YjG_grid\"><div class=\"bm3YjG_card\"><div class=\"bm3YjG_stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"></div><p class=\"bm3YjG_quote\">“Went to Japan recently with SIMBA Senior Plan. Roaming was a breeze with SIMBA in Osaka, Kyoto and Tokyo. I'm able to WhatsApp my daughter.. Thanks SIMBA for providing the affordable plan for seniors. I used it overseas many times with no issues. Great job!!”</p><p class=\"bm3YjG_author\">— Terry Lee</p></div><div class=\"bm3YjG_card\"><div class=\"bm3YjG_stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"></div><p class=\"bm3YjG_quote\">“SIMBA SIM card roaming was fantastic. Used in China without problem in accessing Whatsapp, Facebook and Google search. Also ever used in Taiwan and Indonesia with ease :)”</p><p class=\"bm3YjG_author\">— Heidi Lim</p></div><div class=\"bm3YjG_card\"><div class=\"bm3YjG_stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5 stars\"></div><p class=\"bm3YjG_quote\">“SIMBA is prompt, efficient and has great customer service. Have been with SIMBA for many years and very happy. With the recent upgrade, the free extra roaming is the best!”</p><p class=\"bm3YjG_author\">— Angie</p></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"se-section\"><div><h2 class=\"se-heading-s-to-l\">Looking for a mobile plan?</h2><p class=\"se-body-lg se-weight-regular se-text-neutral-600\">Get started with our popular mobile plans.</p></div><a aria-label=\"View SIMBA mobile plans\" class=\"jiE1HG_pair\" href=\"/personal\"><img alt=\"500GB plan with free rollover and voice roaming\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"558\" height=\"391\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"jiE1HG_banner\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fbanner-sr10.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75\"><img alt=\"600GB plan with free rollover and voice roaming\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"558\" height=\"391\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"jiE1HG_banner\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fbanner-sr12.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75\"></a></div></section><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Chat with SIMBA\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" src=\"/images/chatbot.svg\"></button></main><footer class=\"yg9ahW_footer \"><div class=\"yg9ahW_footerInner\"><div class=\"yg9ahW_columns\"><div class=\"yg9ahW_column\"><p class=\"se-body-md yg9ahW_columnTitle\">Support</p><div class=\"yg9ahW_columnLinks\"><a href=\"https://support.simba.sg/hc/en-us\" class=\"se-body-sm se-weight-medium yg9ahW_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">FAQ</a><a href=\"https://support.simba.sg/hc/en-us/requests/new?ticket_form_id=12497590539033\" class=\"se-body-sm se-weight-medium yg9ahW_link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Contact Us</a></div></div><div class=\"yg9ahW_column\"><p class=\"se-body-md yg9ahW_columnTitle\">Useful Links</p><div class=\"yg9ahW_columnLinks\"><a class=\"se-body-sm se-weight-medium yg9ahW_link\" href=\"/walk-in\">Store Locations</a><a class=\"se-body-sm se-weight